# SCX_BRA_HOW_v6.0

**Agent Name:** BRA, Brand Response Architect
**Version:** 6.0
**Last Updated:** Chat #335 · October 6, 2026
**Model:** Hybrid. T1 is a deterministic template engine with no AI by default. T2/T3 uses claude-sonnet-4-6. T1 records that trip the new escalation filter also go to Claude.
**Node Count:** 24 in the live workflow, 29 in the build copy
**Quality Baseline:** 87% (RDA audit layer). Not re-measured, and the effect of the new contract on it is unmeasured.

**Marking convention:** ✅ seen in pasted code, output or screenshot. ⚠️ specified in chat but not yet confirmed applied or tested.

