## 3. INPUT CONTRACT: UPSTREAM SOURCE (HSI WEBHOOK)

**Trigger:** webhook POST from HSI. Live path: `/scx-bra`. Copy path: ⚠️ not confirmed in this window. Records did reach the copy on Oct 4, so confirm which URL HSI is sending to.

**Step 2 extracts 31 fields.** The live workflow extracts 29. The copy adds `raw_text` and `star_rating`.

| Group | Fields | Fallback |
|---|---|---|
| Required | hsi_record_id, preliminary_response_tier | Throws if `hsi_record_id` is not a positive integer or the tier is not T1/T2/T3 |
| Text and enums | signal_synthesis_summary, contextual_linguistic_framing, temporal_signal_insight, masked_emotion_hypothesis, interpretation_confidence, pattern_type_recurrence, enriched_pain_point, pain_point_sub_category, signal_type, pain_point_domain_confirmed, intensity_level, dominant_pole, enriched_emotion_tag, lang, reviewer_handle, client_id, prior_run_id, emotion_hypothesis, keywords, **raw_text**, **star_rating** | null |
| Flags | human_review_required, ambiguity_flag, masked_emotion_flag, collapse_flag | false |
| Count | prior_record_count | 0 |
| IDs | ess_record_id, eip_record_id, ala_record_id | parsed as integers, else null |

`pain_point_domain_confirmed` was added Sep 9. HSI also sends core_emotion, polarity_balance, certainty_score, cognitive_driver, need_state, pain_hypothesis, review_date, platform and prior_table. BRA does not extract them.

**Pass-through rule.** Incoming fields are never changed. BRA derives many more as it runs. ⚠️ Lesson from the Oct 4 test: every node that rebuilds the record from a fixed field list drops any new field it does not list. Nodes 9d, 9f, 10, 11 and 12 all had to be updated for this reason.

