## 5. TEMPLATE SELECTION LOGIC (T1)

**Table:** `mafv9by73ebama7`, limit 200. The algorithm is unchanged:
1. Filter templates by `Signal Category` equal to `dominant_pole` (default "Negative").
2. Fall back to the full list if nothing matches.
3. Hash `hsi_record_id`, take the absolute value, and select `pool[seed % pool.length]`.
4. The same ID always gets the same template.

Fields used: `Template Name` becomes `solution_type`, `Signal-Based Consideration` is copied, and `Id` becomes `t1_template_id`.

Step 9b2 does not use the template's text. The Template Library has no closing-objective column, and none was approved. So the T1 repair rule "re-pull the closing from the template default" is not implementable. Step 9g uses the constant "neutral_close".

⚠️ **Open Gap #7:** the library's row count and domain breakdown (older docs say 21 templates across 13 domains) are still unverified.

