## 6. CLAUDE GENERATION (T2/T3)

**Model:** claude-sonnet-4-6. **Max tokens:** 2000. **Temperature:** 0.3. **Retry:** the HTTP call retries 3 times, and the contract loop gets one extra Claude attempt (Step 9g).

**Output, 17 fields:**

| Field | Values |
|---|---|
| emotional_axis | short phrase |
| signal_based_consideration | internal guidance |
| urgency_level | Immediate / Standard / Monitoring |
| commercial_risk_flag | true / false |
| governance_flag | None / Flag / Halt |
| behavioral_interpretation | 2-3 sentences |
| must_reflect | list of entries: concept, action, priority, source_type, source_span / upstream_origin / verification_source, relevance_confidence |
| may_reflect | same shape, optional |
| must_not_introduce | list |
| commercial_restriction_types | refund / discount / price_promise / compensation / … |
| primary_claim_type | experiential / policy_procedural / factual_allegation |
| verification_state | not_applicable / guest_report_only / corroborated / disputed |
| highest_risk_class | normal / elevated / high_liability |
| strictest_epistemic_posture | acknowledge_without_fault_admission / neutral_acknowledgment / escalate_to_human |
| closing_objective | warm_return_invitation / appreciative_close / offline_contact_invitation / neutral_close / no_public_close_escalate |
| halt_reason | contract_validation_failure / high_liability_guest_signal / null |
| schema_version | response_contract_v1 |

`direct_apology` is retired and never offered. `tone_style` is removed.

